><surname>Rogers</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bresnahan</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cell death in models of spinal cord injury</article-title><source>Prog Brain Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>137</volume><fpage>37</fpage><lpage>47</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0079-6123(02)37006-7</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Beattie MS, Hermann GE, Rogers RC, Bresnahan JC (2002) Cell death in models of spinal cord injury. Prog Brain Res 137:37&#x02013;47 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12440358</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beckman</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oxidative damage and tyrosine nitration from peroxynitrite</article-title><source>Chem Res Toxicol</source><year>1996</year><volume>9</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>836</fpage><lpage>844</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/tx9501445</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Beckman JS (1996) Oxidative damage and tyrosine nitration from peroxynitrite. Chem Res Toxicol 9(5):836&#x02013;844 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8828918</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Butterfield</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kanski</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Brain protein oxidation in age-related neurodegenerative disorders that are associated with aggregated proteins</article-title><source>Mech Ageing Dev</source><year>2001</year><volume>122</volume><issue>9</issue><fpage>945</fpage><lpage>962</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0047-6374(01)00249-4</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Butterfield DA, Kanski J (2001) Brain protein oxidation in age-relate